.TH "LIBUNBOUND" "3" "May 20, 2026" "1.25.1" "Unbound"
.SH NAME
libunbound \- Unbound DNS validating resolver 1.25.1 functions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.sp
\fB#include <unbound.h>\fP
